55:## Checks\n285:## Findings\n305:## The format of review-security-review.md\n339:## Examples\n383:## Checks\n409:## Checks\n424:## Checks\n438:## Checks\n443:### Tests (table-driven, no network)\n705:### Done-when evaluation (manual, owner; recorded on the PR)\n737:### Proposal edits (same PR)\n747:### Out of scope (part A)\n757:### Part B: draft body for the new issue\n784:### Part C: the human PR for ard's own `.ard/` (owner)\n794:### Risks\n801:### Open questions\n819:### Resolved open questions (owner, 2026-11-23)\n833:## Comments\n835:### ard-bot-albertcbrown[bot] at 2026-11-23T14:52:04Z\n842:## Routing\n845:## Open issues\n854:### albertcbrown at 2026-11-23T15:18:04Z\n858:### ard-bot-albertcbrown[bot] at 2026-11-23T15:39:27Z\n866:== .ard/triage/engineer/prompt.txt\n872:== .ard/triage/lead/prompt.txt\n878:== .ard/workers/engineer/prompt.txt\n884:== .ard/reviewers/eng-review/prompt.txt\n     931 /ard-home/.claude/projects/-Users-al--ard-work-albertcbrown-ard-01M84P6J910RB7P7CZ91E438AY/621b6553-546d-42e8-a7ee-532aca22d9d9/tool-results/bzzz0pt4a.txt","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_012bMb2DGmYo6enrPJFZqXHK","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
